cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Does prompt-form tightness predict Assistant-Axis projection?
abstract: >-
  A preregistered within-topic test of whether holding content, token count and
  base-model perplexity constant while manipulating prompt form (loose free verse
  vs strict structural constraint) moves a model's per-turn projection on the
  Assistant Axis. Three arms on Qwen3-32B and Gemma-2-27B with a capping
  manipulation and a replication; stimuli, code and result files released.
message: If you use this study, cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
